{"ref":"BDB, תְּקוֹעִי","hw":"תְּקוֹעִי","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">תְּקוֹעִי</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">תְּקֹעִי</span></big>  <strong>adj.gent.</strong> of foregoing: <span dir=\"rtl\">הַתּ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 23:26\" href=\"/II_Samuel.23.26\">2 S 23:26</a> = <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 11:28\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.11.28\">1 Ch 11:28</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 27:9\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.27.9\">27:9</a>; f. <span dir=\"rtl\">הָאִשָּׁה הַתְּקֹעִית</span> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 14:4\" href=\"/II_Samuel.14.4\">2 S 14:4</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 14:9\" href=\"/II_Samuel.14.9\">9</a>; pl. as subst. <span dir=\"rtl\">הַתְּקוֹעִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 3:5\" href=\"/Nehemiah.3.5\">Ne 3:5</a>, <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 3:27\" href=\"/Nehemiah.3.27\">27</a>.","next":"BDB, תָּקֵף","prev":"BDB, תְּקוֹעַ"}